Execute(Runtime, Behavior, Input) -> InternalResult

InternalResult = Ok(Value) | Error(Cause)

Only(Runtime, ExecuteFunction)
Not(Agent, ExecuteFunction)
Not(Actor, ExecuteFunction)
Not(BehaviorImplementation, EmitEvent)
Not(ActionImplementation, EmitEvent)

BehaviorLabel = AgentName.IntentName

Execute(Runtime, Behavior[BehaviorLabel], Input) = Ok(Value)
  -> SideEffect(Runtime, Emit(BehaviorLabel.Ok, Value))

Execute(Runtime, Behavior[BehaviorLabel], Input) = Error(Cause)
  -> SideEffect(Runtime, Emit(BehaviorLabel.Error, Cause))

EventLabel is Derived, not Configured
EventEmission is a Runtime SideEffect of Behavior Execution
